# The sprite art and audio are deterministic output, and the build verifies them
# by byte comparison. Declare them binary explicitly so no line-ending or filter
# transform can ever rewrite them.
*.png binary
*.wav binary
*.car binary

# Generated by XcodeGen from project.yml. Collapsed in diffs because reviewing
# it by hand is not useful: review the project.yml change instead, and
# regenerate rather than resolving a conflict here.
*.pbxproj linguist-generated=true
